### Créer un administrateur (si pas encore en base)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### Connexion de l’admin
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

# Copie le token retourné ici pour les prochaines requêtes
@adminToken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImFkbWluQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6ImFkbWluIiwiaWF0IjoxNzQ0NjAxOTEyfQ.77Wxlj7uOvOLtxgbbMyARxPB41LovPjbXrIEkjiR7os

###

### Créer un nouvel utilisateur (via admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/new
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "User1",
  "email": "user1@example.com",
  "password": "user123",
  "role": "user"
}

###

### Créer un technicien
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/new
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Technicien1",
  "email": "tech1@example.com",
  "password": "tech123",
  "role": "technician"
}

### Connexion du technicien
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tech1@example.com",
  "password": "tech123"
}

### Connexion de l’utilisateur
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@example.com",
  "password": "user123"
}

# Copie le token retourné ici pour tester les routes user
@userToken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6Miwicm9sZSI6InVzZXIiLCJpYXQiOjE3NDQ2MDIwMzV9.tXdKigg0JTiRbybGk-x5ONguqJplwRlYEmGIfEu4l2A

###

### Créer un ticket (user ou technicien connecté)
POST http://localhost:3000/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Problème d'accès",
  "description": "Je n'arrive pas à me connecter",
  "status": "open",
  "userId": 2,
  "technicianId": null,
  "createdAt": "2025-04-13"
}

###

### Récupérer tous les tickets (technicien = tous, user = les siens)
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### Voir les détails d’un ticket
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### Modifier un ticket (nécessite un technicien connecté)
# Remplacer par un token de technicien
@technicianToken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6Mywicm9sZSI6InRlY2huaWNpYW4iLCJpYXQiOjE3NDQ2MDIyOTV9.iOx7IF_yVMsZKJD9zbDHTJwmkuOcHKO9kGhZEXFmlPk

PUT http://localhost:3000/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Accès rétabli",
  "description": "Connexion maintenant possible",
  "status": "closed",
  "userId": 2,
  "technicianId": 3,
  "createdAt": "2025-04-13",
  "closedAt": "2025-04-14"
}

###

### Voir les détails d’un ticket
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}

### Supprimer un ticket (admin seulement)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/admin/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
